                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400">
                            <span>Согласные сами разложатся по гласным А-О-У-Э-И-Ы</span>
                            <span id="newDictionPreviewCount" class="font-mono font-bold text-studio-cyan">0 слогов</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="newDictionPreviewBox" class="hidden bg-studio-card/80 border border-studio-border rounded-xl p-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-h-20 overflow-y-auto"></div>
                    <button onclick="saveCustomDictionTable()" class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-studio-amber hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-xs transition">
